%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: ComposerDialogues_music_being_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a53db399ebd1bfa40802d506c88e745d, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1528356864
    m_Localized: So you're the one who beat my students? I was here before the first
      note.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077120
    m_Localized: Bach, Mozart, Wagner... they all asked my permission. You didn't
      even knock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077121
    m_Localized: That song of yours... I discarded it ten thousand years ago. Too
      predictable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077122
    m_Localized: I am do, re and mi at once. You are, at best, background noise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077123
    m_Localized: Before rhythm existed, I was already tapping my feet. Shall we?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077124
    m_Localized: Summoned with a four-bar loop? How disrespectful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077125
    m_Localized: Relax, I'll only use one octave. For now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077126
    m_Localized: Silence is music too. You're about to hear plenty of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077127
    m_Localized: Did you tune up before coming? I can hear it from here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077128
    m_Localized: 'Welcome to the original stage. The acoustics are perfect: I made
      them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077129
    m_Localized: Hm. An unexpected chord. I liked it... a little.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077130
    m_Localized: You played in time. Three times in a row. I'll make a note.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077131
    m_Localized: I didn't see that syncopation coming. And I see everything coming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077132
    m_Localized: 'Fine, fine: you''ve got more rhythm than you look.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077133
    m_Localized: First bar to you. The score is still long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077134
    m_Localized: You put me out of tune. Nobody's ever done that. Interesting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077135
    m_Localized: Good. You've mastered C major. Now comes the tricky one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077136
    m_Localized: I recognise that melody. It was mine, but you said it with style.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077137
    m_Localized: A perfect cadence... against me. The nerve.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077138
    m_Localized: 'I''ll applaud. With one hand only: the other keeps time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077139
    m_Localized: Back to rehearsal with you. I was already at the premiere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077140
    m_Localized: You froze on a crotchet rest. A very long one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077141
    m_Localized: Again? Of course. Music always returns to the theme.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077142
    m_Localized: Sorry, I wrote this ending.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077143
    m_Localized: You have potential. Like a triangle in the back row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077144
    m_Localized: 'You lost the beat. I''ll keep it: every beat is mine.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077145
    m_Localized: Not a high C. Not a C of any kind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077146
    m_Localized: Bravo! Oh no, that was the echo of my own bravo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077147
    m_Localized: 'Study your music theory and come back. I''ll wait: I have all eternity.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077148
    m_Localized: The audience wants an encore. Of me, not you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077149
    m_Localized: You're back. Now I play with the full orchestra.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077150
    m_Localized: Before, I was only tuning. Now the symphony begins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077151
    m_Localized: 'I can hear your heart: 140 bpm. Too fast for an adagio.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077152
    m_Localized: Every note you play, I've played before. And better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077153
    m_Localized: Today I'll modulate to a key that doesn't have a name yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077154
    m_Localized: The metronome is mine. And right now it's speeding up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077155
    m_Localized: I've got eighty violins inside me. All of them out of tune against
      you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077156
    m_Localized: The great masters were rehearsals. You're the soundcheck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077157
    m_Localized: Get ready for a crescendo that never ends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077158
    m_Localized: No rests this time. Everything fortissimo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077159
    m_Localized: You survived my tutti. Few live to tell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077160
    m_Localized: That counterpoint was supposed to be mine. You stole it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077161
    m_Localized: Fine. You deserve a seventh chord. No more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077162
    m_Localized: You made me miss my cue. Me. I AM every cue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077163
    m_Localized: 'I accept defeat like a fermata: brief and elegant.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077164
    m_Localized: Your melody had something... I don't know what. I'll find out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077165
    m_Localized: Second movement to you. The third is my favourite.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077166
    m_Localized: You found the blue note. And I'd hidden it so well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077167
    m_Localized: 'Alright: you can join my band. Tambourine, for now.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077168
    m_Localized: You made the harmony resonate. It tickles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077169
    m_Localized: The symphony ends when I say so. And I say so now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077170
    m_Localized: Too many notes, too few ideas.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077171
    m_Localized: You tripped on a 7/8 bar. A classic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077172
    m_Localized: I enjoyed your defeat. It had a good tempo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077173
    m_Localized: The whole hall is silent. Out of respect. For me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077174
    m_Localized: You played with feeling. The wrong feeling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077175
    m_Localized: Here's a blank score, on the house. Start there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077176
    m_Localized: 'Don''t worry: history will remember you as a footnote.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077177
    m_Localized: Your solo lasted less than a glissando.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077178
    m_Localized: You'll be back. Everyone returns to the tonic in the end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077179
    m_Localized: I am no longer an orchestra. I am the sound of the universe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077180
    m_Localized: The stars vibrate at my frequency. You'll vibrate too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077181
    m_Localized: Before the Big Bang there was a count-in. I called it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077182
    m_Localized: 'This is my final form: every song at once.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077183
    m_Localized: Every time anyone hummed, it was me. Now I hum against you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077184
    m_Localized: You beat the masters and my orchestras. Only absolute silence remains.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077185
    m_Localized: Sorry, there's no pause button here. There never was.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077186
    m_Localized: Win, and music is yours. Lose, and you become a background chord.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077187
    m_Localized: The whole history of music fits in this bar. Go ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077188
    m_Localized: 'Listen carefully: this is the last A you''ll ever tune to.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077189
    m_Localized: Incredible. You beat me... and it still sounded good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077190
    m_Localized: Alright. From now on, whenever someone sings in the shower, I'll
      think of you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077191
    m_Localized: You played me by heart. Even I didn't know myself that well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077192
    m_Localized: I accept. My next symphony is dedicated to you. Reluctantly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077193
    m_Localized: You found the lost chord. I'd been looking for it forever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077194
    m_Localized: Very well, maestro. But for the record, I invented rhythm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077195
    m_Localized: You silenced music itself. Who knows what will play now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077196
    m_Localized: A standing ovation from the galaxies. They're very loud, galaxies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077197
    m_Localized: You won the last note. Enjoy it, it doesn't last long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077198
    m_Localized: 'Bring down the curtain. And don''t touch anything: the piano is
      mine.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077199
    m_Localized: The universe remains in tune. Thanks for taking part.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077200
    m_Localized: You came close. A semitone, at most.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077201
    m_Localized: Music always wins. It's in the name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077202
    m_Localized: Start again from the first bar. I'll wait for you at the end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1587077203
    m_Localized: Nice try. I'll put it on a compilation of oddities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1599660032
    m_Localized: You lost to a concept. The concept is delighted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1599660033
    m_Localized: The stars are laughing in C major.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1599660034
    m_Localized: You were my favourite note today. The only one, actually.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1599660035
    m_Localized: 'Don''t worry: even Beethoven needed nine symphonies.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1599660036
    m_Localized: 'Finale, applause, curtain. And the star, as always: me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
